  <description>
    <p>The drafting table you already know how to use. CadCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in CadCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Draw with coordinates</li>
      <li>Snap to points on objects</li>
      <li>Select objects</li>
      <li>Lasso selection</li>
      <li>Move, copy, rotate, scale, mirror, stretch and array</li>
      <li>Copy, paste and duplicate</li>
      <li>Split the screen</li>
      <li>Load applications (APPLOAD)</li>
      <li>Sheet sets</li>
      <li>Edit command aliases</li>
      <li>Offset, trim, extend, fillet and chamfer walls</li>
      <li>Trim and extend</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
